  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): ASC 230 does not prescribe whether debt issuance costs must be presented gross or net within financing activities. Both approaches are acceptable in practice. ASU 2015-03 (ASC 835-30-45) requires netting on the balance sheet, but that requirement does not extend to the cash flow statement.
Wrong (A): This incorrectly assumes the balance sheet netting requirement under ASU 2015-03 also dictates cash flow presentation. The two statements have independent presentation rules.
