Wrong (A): A voluntary change from LIFO to FIFO is a classic change in accounting principle squarely within ASC 250''s scope, requiring retrospective application.
Wrong (B): A change in depreciation method from DDB to straight-line is treated as a change in accounting estimate effected by a change in principle under ASC 250.
