-- Q12348: Accounting Changes and Error Corrections [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under ASC 250-10-45-17, a change in accounting estimate is applied prospectively in the period of change and future periods. Pinnacle applies the 5% warranty rate beginning in Year 3 with no restatement of prior periods.
Wrong (A): Estimate changes are never applied retrospectively under ASC 250. Restating prior years at the new rate would contradict the prospective treatment requirement.
Wrong (C): A cumulative catch-up adjustment is not permitted for estimate changes. Only the current and future periods reflect the revised estimate.
