Wrong (B): The $30,000 figure confuses the after-tax retained earnings effect ($40,000 x 75%) with the inventory adjustment. Inventory increases by the gross $40,000 difference.
Wrong (C): The $55,000 is the Year 2 difference. The question asks about the December 31, Year 1, balance sheet, which uses the Year 1 difference of $40,000.
